{"product_id":"suede-leather-casual-shoes","title":"Suede Cappuccino leather casual Shoes","description":"\u003cp\u003eRO:\u003cspan\u003eRealizați din piele întoarsă premium, adidașii D’Ortenzi definesc o nouă perspectivă asupra eleganței casual. Silueta curată, platforma modernă și textura fină creează un echilibru perfect între rafinament și funcționalitate.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eAcești adidași nu sunt doar o alegere stilistică, ci o declarație a bunului gust – dedicați celor care apreciază calitatea italiană și estetica discretă, dar puternică.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eEN: Crafted \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003efrom premium Italian suede, the D’Ortenzi sneakers redefine understated elegance. With a sleek silhouette, elevated sole, and refined texture, they offer a perfect fusion of modern design and luxurious comfort.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eMore than footwear, they’re a statement of taste – designed for those who value quality, simplicity, and the sophistication of effortless style\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"D’Ortenzi","offers":[{"title":"35","offer_id":52205455901008,"sku":null,"price":690.0,"currency_code":"RON","in_stock":true},{"title":"36","offer_id":52205455868240,"sku":null,"price":690.0,"currency_code":"RON","in_stock":true},{"title":"37","offer_id":52205455835472,"sku":null,"price":690.0,"currency_code":"RON","in_stock":true},{"title":"38","offer_id":52205455802704,"sku":null,"price":690.0,"currency_code":"RON","in_stock":true},{"title":"39","offer_id":52205455769936,"sku":null,"price":690.0,"currency_code":"RON","in_stock":true},{"title":"40","offer_id":52205455737168,"sku":null,"price":690.0,"currency_code":"RON","in_stock":true},{"title":"41","offer_id":52214048948560,"sku":null,"price":690.0,"currency_code":"RON","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/09